---NOTES---
This collective statement responds to Periyar's proposed marriage to Maniammai and the associated succession dispute; that context is made explicit here only as a translator's note. The Tamil source itself remains unchanged. Several abbreviated organisations and one office are OCR-damaged, so the English expands only forms that are contextually clear and labels the others uncertain.
